<title>FINLAND: PENOPE SWINGS TO FIM 1.07 MLN 4-MTH PROFIT.</title>
<headline>PENOPE SWINGS TO FIM 1.07 MLN 4-MTH PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to April 30,</p>
<p>					    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   1.07 vs 0.73 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.80 vs 0.86 loss</p>
